{{Term/Store|Snow Boots|Snow Boots|Series, BotW, TotK|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Snow Boots grant the [[Snow Speed Up]] [[Added Effect]], allowing [[Link]] to travel more quickly on [[Snow]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can be worn in [[Gerudo Town]] along with the [[Gerudo Veil]] and [[Gerudo Top]]. 

To obtain them, Link must wear the [[Gerudo Outfit]] and talk to [[Bozai]] outside Gerudo Town. By accepting [[The Eighth Heroine]] [[Side Quest]], he will temporarily be given the Snow Boots.<ref name="BotW Bozai"/> Once Link has completed the Side Quest, he will return the Snow Boots in exchange for the [[Sand Boots]]. Afterwards, Link can obtain the Snow Boots permanently by talking to Bozai again and completing [[The Forgotten Sword]] Side Quest. Once they are acquired, [[Granté]] will begin to sell the Snow Boots in [[Tarrey Town]].

Snow Boots can be both upgraded at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]] and [[Hateno Dye|Dyed]] at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

